WildMIDI is a simple software midi player
which has a core softsynth library that can be used in other applications.

The WildMIDI library converts MIDI files into audio
which is then passed back to the calling application.
Instruments can come from Gravis Ultrasound patch files,
SoundFont2 (SF2) files, GENMIDI (OP2) FM banks,
or the built-in OPL3 FM synthesizer. 
The library API is designed so that it is easy to include WildMIDI
into applications that wish to include MIDI file playback.
